    "innovation": "This paper provides one of the first CMIP6-based, reservoir-scale inflow assessments for Brazil, demonstrating that climate change will simultaneously increase average water availability and intensify hydrological extremes, thus challenging traditional hydropower risk management approaches that are based on mean flows.",
